" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\"\u003e橙柒柒\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd1 代价与回报\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/04/28/5700838/9be497157c0d046d0189f344e835c81d_5650535521785458389.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e「衷心祝愿你能勇敢前行，不负期望。」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd2 不愿重蹈覆辙\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/04/28/5700838/35e11ea0e27cf7ae1eafbbd74d6a98fc_5590837634026787226.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e哪怕虚弱无比，她还是选择了挺身而出。或许是想要证明，或许是不愿后悔。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd3 不可说之事\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/04/28/5700838/03d0bc51cc055f9df208f3e7670daf0c_984073422324043864.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e遵守与「她」的约定就不得不违背与她的承诺，真是棘手啊。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd4 水到渠成\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/04/28/5700838/c9eed0ab485467e945e7efe18bf9ce47_73368275846377397.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e自然而然，不可思议，这一切都值得她久久回味...\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd5 星空的期盼\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/04/28/5700838/3233741b0ae4ef9c89f3ded8a5990609_145050725449110032.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e虽然无法见面，但「她」与她会一直携手同行。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd5 片刻安眠\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/04/28/5700838/e73ebd0e222504cf22e68996d5d00562_6045564901187760627.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e也不知道她是累了，还是终于放松了下来...弥足珍贵的时刻，再多守护一会吧。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1372","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"攻略方法","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"1373","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":true,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1702959502","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"95","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"771","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1367","pos":"left"},{"id":"1368","pos":"right"},{"id":"1369","pos":"left"},{"id":"1370","pos":"left"},{"id":"1371","pos":"right"},{"id":"1372","pos":"banner"},{"id":"1373","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"}]}]},"edit_lock_status":"Unlock","correct_lock_status":"Unlock","menus":[{"id":"43","name":"任务","has_page":false,"style":"","sub_menus":[],"icon":"","mi18n_key":"任务","is_hidden":false,"parent_id":"189","template_id":"","bg_img":"","ch_ext":"[{\"type\":\"text\",\"attribute_name\":\"每行个数\",\"attribute_key\":\"col_per_row\",\"value\":\